，大將軍匿諱之。居無何，敢從上雍，至甘泉宮獵。驃騎將軍去病與青有親，射殺敢。去病時方貴幸，上諱云鹿觸殺之。居歳餘，去病死。而敢有女爲太子中人，愛幸，敢男禹有寵於太子，然好利，李氏陵遲衰微矣。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0078","c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0124","c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0209","c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0213","c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0224","c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0243"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p029","quote":"衛子夫已立為皇后，先是衛長君死，乃以衛青為將軍，擊胡有功，封為長平侯。青三子在襁褓中，皆封為列侯。及衛皇后所謂姊衛少兒，少兒生子霍去病，以軍功封冠軍侯，號驃騎將軍。青號大將軍。立衛皇后子據為太子。衛氏枝屬以軍功起家，五人為侯。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0064"]}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p029","text":"衛子夫已立為皇后，先是衛長君死，乃以衛青為將軍，擊胡有功，封為長平侯。青三子在襁褓中，皆封為列侯。及衛皇后所謂姊衛少兒，少兒生子霍去病，以軍功封冠軍侯，號驃騎將軍。青號大將軍。立衛皇后子據為太子。衛氏枝屬以軍功起家，五人為侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"衛子夫","kind":"person","person_id":"l5c_h8i_d5q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"衛長君","kind":"person","person_id":"5nt_1fk_g2o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"衛青","kind":"person","person_id":"5dd_l1c_6g8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"5dd_l1c_6g8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"三子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"衛皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"l5c_h8i_d5q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"衛少兒","kind":"person","person_id":"25o_mn8_27w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0060","st